      "type": "diagram",
      "svg": "<svg viewBox=\"0 0 1100 1100\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1100\" height=\"1100\" fill=\"#1a1a2e\"/><text x=\"550\" y=\"70\" font-size=\"34\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ffd700\" text-anchor=\"middle\">PRIYA'S ONE-PAGE PLAN</text><text x=\"550\" y=\"112\" font-size=\"20\" fill=\"#888\" text-anchor=\"middle\">29-year-old teacher, five pillars, five commitments</text><rect x=\"50\" y=\"170\" width=\"1000\" height=\"130\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#ef4444\" fill-opacity=\"0.12\" stroke=\"#ef4444\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"90\" y=\"212\" font-size=\"21\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#ef4444\" text-anchor=\"start\">OBSTACLE</text><text x=\"90\" y=\"244\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"start\">Laziness disguised as busyness</text><text x=\"90\" y=\"270\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"start\">Fix: 20-minute review, first Saturday monthly</text><rect x=\"50\" y=\"320\" width=\"1000\" height=\"130\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" fill-opacity=\"0.12\" stroke=\"#f59e0b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"90\" y=\"362\" font-size=\"21\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#f59e0b\" text-anchor=\"start\">QUADRANT</text><text x=\"90\" y=\"394\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"start\">Currently 100% Employee (E)</text><text x=\"90\" y=\"420\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"start\">Target: E + I, 15% of income invested in 3 years</text><rect x=\"50\" y=\"470\" width=\"1000\" height=\"130\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#10b981\" fill-opacity=\"0.12\" stroke=\"#10b981\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"90\" y=\"512\" font-size=\"21\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#10b981\" text-anchor=\"start\">ASSET TEST</text><text x=\"90\" y=\"544\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"start\">Positive cash flow after every expense, or</text><text x=\"90\" y=\"570\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"start\">a diversified low-cost index fund held for years</text><rect x=\"50\" y=\"620\" width=\"1000\" height=\"130\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#0ea5e9\" fill-opacity=\"0.12\" stroke=\"#0ea5e9\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"90\" y=\"662\" font-size=\"21\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#0ea5e9\" text-anchor=\"start\">PROTECTION TRIGGER</text><text x=\"90\" y=\"694\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"start\">Meet an attorney, form an LLC before closing</text><text x=\"90\" y=\"720\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"start\">Target: first rental property within 18 months</text><rect x=\"50\" y=\"770\" width=\"1000\" height=\"130\" rx=\"18\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" fill-opacity=\"0.12\" stroke=\"#8b5cf6\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"90\" y=\"812\" font-size=\"21\" font-weight=\"bold\" fill=\"#8b5cf6\" text-anchor=\"start\">DEAL PIPELINE</text><text x=\"90\" y=\"844\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"start\">Review 5 rental listings weekly using checklist</text><text x=\"90\" y=\"870\" font-size=\"16\" fill=\"#ffffff\" text-anchor=\"start\">Log every rejection and its reason in a spreadsheet</text></svg>",
      "caption": "Five specific, dated commitments, not five vague intentions"
